---
title: Tomatillo Salsa
servings: 1
tags:
  - condiment
source:
  name: Serious Eats
  url: https://www.seriouseats.com/grilling-tomatillo-salsa-recipe
-- introduction: 
---

Husk, clean, and grill @tomatillos{8%oz}(halved) cut-side down until slightly charred and starting to soften, flip and char/soften the other side. Let cool.

Let @tomatillos{} cool, then blend. 

Add @garlic cloves{2}, @jalapeno{1}(seeded), @cilantro{1/3%cup}(chopped), @onion{1/2}(small), and @water{1/4%cup} and continue to blend, @salt{} to taste.
> add some sugar if its too tart.

